Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Treatment of the point at s=-Infinity", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996919924000721*^9, 3.9969199620575542`*^9}, {
  3.996983614654891*^9, 
  3.996983618717971*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"83e999e2-724a-46a7-9519-\
ce3889f21ba6"],

Cell["\<\
We repeat the calculation for the point s=-Infinity. First we compute the \
corresponding differential equation (in our implementation the equation will \
be in z (replacing z->-1/s gives the expansion at s=-Infinity).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996982139716763*^9, 3.996982158542962*^9}, {
  3.997955567597499*^9, 3.997955568607997*^9}, {3.998307481036872*^9, 
